desc: Convert this CSV to a markdown table
category: ex
par: 30
hint1: Substitution + manual header separator
hint2: Replace commas with ' | ', add leading/trailing pipes, then type the --- row
solution: :%s/,/ | /g<CR> :%s/^/| <CR> :%s/$/ |<CR> + manual sep
note: Turn commas into ' | ', add a leading and trailing pipe, then hand-type the |---| row.
--- START ---
name,age,city
Alice,30,NYC
Bob,25,LA
Carol,35,SF
--- GOAL ---
| name | age | city |
|------|-----|------|
| Alice | 30 | NYC |
| Bob | 25 | LA |
| Carol | 35 | SF |
--- END ---
